msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:168
msgid "Comment on ALL Projects"
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:169
msgid ""
"Allows users to comment on ALL Projects, regardless of Project sharing and visibility settings.\n"
"\n"
"This permission also requires the **View ALL Projects** permission."
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:187
msgid "Edit ALL Projects"
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:188
msgid ""
"Allows users to edit ALL Projects, regardless of Project sharing and visibility settings.\n"
"\n"
"This permission also requires the **View ALL Projects** and **Comment on ALL Projects** permissions."
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:206
msgid "Manage ALL Projects"
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:207
msgid ""
"Allows users to manage ALL Projects as if they were owners, regardless of Project sharing and visibility settings.\n"
"\n"
"This permission also requires the **View ALL Projects**, **Comment on ALL Projects**, and **Edit ALL Projects** permissions."
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:225
msgid "Manage Project Templates"
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:226
msgid ""
"Allows users to set Projects as Project templates.\n"
"\n"
"Users with this permission can also create new Projects directly from Knowledge Models, even when project creation is restricted to templates."
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:244
msgid "Create Projects"
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:245
msgid "Allows users to create new Projects."
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:263
msgid "Use Knowledge Model Editor"
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:264
msgid ""
"Allows users to view, create, edit, and delete Knowledge Model Editors, migrate them, and publish Knowledge Models from them.\n"
"\n"
"This permission also requires the **Manage Knowledge Models** permission."
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:282
msgid "Manage Knowledge Models"
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:283
msgid ""
"Allows users to import, export, and delete Knowledge Models, as well as set them as deprecated, restore them, or set them as public.\n"
"\n"
"This permission also allows users to manage Knowledge Model Secrets."
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:301
msgid "Use Document Template Editor"
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:302
msgid ""
"Allows users to view, create, edit, and delete Document Template Editors, as well as publish Document Templates from them.\n"
"\n"
"This permission also requires the **Manage Document Templates** permission."
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:320
msgid "Manage Document Templates"
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:321
msgid "Allows users to import, export, and delete Document Templates, as well as set them as deprecated or restore them."
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:339
msgid "Manage Users"
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:340
msgid "Allows users to view, create, edit, and delete user accounts, and to set their role."
msgstr ""

#: packages/elm-common/elm/Common/Data/WizardRolePermission.elm:358
